  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1400",
    "issue_date": "2026-10-02T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-02T12:17:14.997Z",
    "meteorologist": "Rojan Lamichhane",
    "analysis_np": "देशभर मनसुनी वायु र पश्चिमी वायुको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "The country is currently under the influence of monsoon winds and a partial influence of westerly winds.",
    "today_np": "कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्ने तथा लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। देशका तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल रही बिहानपख हुस्सु लाग्नेछ। कोशी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा तथा बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा  हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, while partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Terai areas of the country, with mist likely during the morning hours. Light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Koshi Province and at one or two places in the hilly areas of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको  हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमामा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। देशका तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागको थोरै स्थानमा मध्यमसम्मको तथा कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। मधेश प्रदेश लगायत कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, while partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Terai areas of the country.  Moderate rainfall is likely at a few places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, and light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Moderate rainfall is likely at one or two places in the Terai areas of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces, as well as in Madhesh Province.",
    "special": ""
  }
